{
  "project_id": "prj-0082e632-8ef7-4b09-b35b-dfb50c9875a0",
  "draft_id": "draft-02e0b50e-d905-4037-8503-93e07fabc304",
  "draft_revision": 2,
  "draft_body": "昨日温岚尚未得知银钥匙的用途。今日她读完陈澈的信，才知道银钥匙能打开潮汐档案柜。",
  "draft_body_sha256": "c4127523dcbbd745a7742fc3448bfb655c5a28854a362b097c244ebb683b50d3",
  "source_revision": 1,
  "memory_version": 4,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-96726799-60ba-47c6-bcd6-d17b4946058f",
      "chapter_number": 1,
      "chapter_title": "雾钟",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-840a4c7e-fe1e-4144-8950-170d46d4521e",
      "span_body": "灰港的雾钟只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次，别的潮声不会让它响。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "94ba09a3cf9e29cb6a363a03322de398f60a9af31d2a89b50a916f392ec5e12e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-8e9e9358-f43c-40fe-b46d-a1bc9b58ae5e",
      "chapter_number": 2,
      "chapter_title": "裂纹罗盘",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-5d3c9127-ca65-4f4d-8943-0951c7f429a5",
      "span_body": "黄铜罗盘的镜面有一道月牙裂纹，此刻由苏岑放在外套内袋。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "68dacbc00263341e60fdeb68f264492dc0953140827d264994dcd12e9a26b422"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-b7887073-ae9e-43e1-9108-aab9b9ca26b5",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "chapter_title": "迟到的渡船",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-3bd49ed9-91a1-498d-b655-55b2344e6c2c",
      "span_body": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "bfc55c345ab2ca0d5d343ea3733b01bf801a9aac8b040685f711076b08bd8b03"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-1cd1cd47-6f9a-47d4-bde0-a56316feb658",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "chapter_title": "无字潮表",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-e872cc39-0288-4032-a2cc-d4abd0bc9bc2",
      "span_body": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "2b42960d67fb622a2484050f9afe31dea302dd059c7dda3cf0d31eab4a70bbd3"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-b198ceec-b2d9-47c6-9f9e-084b7c473578",
      "chapter_number": 5,
      "chapter_title": "盐雾信箱",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-e3e3b2ad-448f-4e05-b0c5-0878f9083550",
      "span_body": "纸条只写着‘白色渡船没有靠岸’，署名和日期都被盐雾抹去了。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8a0f8a53b219be663bc27b02decd36f0f5600f1e703c9b71f82dae2b4b3f1387"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-50dc72fe-b343-4d90-9995-9042bafe36ea",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "chapter_title": "低室电台",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-57cef9dd-aa3d-4022-bd08-98129849a320",
      "span_body": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8cfce58f0ce8de9ee07de1a3123b29e091c5b1917928caf4f6a90dfc79f04c3e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-7df83160-3351-4b25-ba29-4a0d95cd0d2a",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "chapter_title": "潮线之外",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-5d8118e2-5683-4964-92d1-c4b5e51a61b3",
      "span_body": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "82d77670ec3f945f5da30dd608e7accd6640a3f09bf103c54114bcf52141e1ff"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-80e7076f-78cb-41dc-8ff5-5af844a2891f",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "chapter_title": "北堤灯火",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-21e1c9cb-94b1-459c-a789-c2684371e275",
      "span_body": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "ab75da7e0d3ec24955927e77a13bcf72efac68cf8d8d7d84922e5f0cbfb6dbcd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-462f329a-b37b-4bcd-acd3-a9975feb5cd3",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "chapter_title": "换手",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-0dc5980b-af67-4185-a121-c897a31f78a0",
      "span_body": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b07ea48fcdc8ed1f76041a0cd9188055ec40adeef4a969b63b212357bef229dd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-5e22318f-8e07-4572-9089-2933c0ab1965",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "chapter_title": "回声坐标",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-a43ce12a-6e8c-4a2f-864d-ca3d44e3a663",
      "span_body": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b3265433a0a1022e4d049a4768879f6763f8db0dbca1c858802e228639ea3e6c"
    }
  ],
